WEBVTT

00:04:28.682 --> 00:04:32.672
I can't promise you that you'll ever truly
know if you've made the perfect decision,

00:04:32.696 --> 00:04:33.898
but I can tell you this:

00:04:33.922 --> 00:04:36.113
a significant percentage
of people in the world

00:04:36.137 --> 00:04:38.348
will never have to worry about FOBO.

00:04:38.372 --> 00:04:41.198
Unlike the billions of people
who have few options, if any,

00:04:41.222 --> 00:04:43.648
due to war, poverty or illness,

00:04:43.672 --> 00:04:46.938
you have plentiful opportunities
to live decisively.

00:04:46.962 --> 00:04:48.677
You may not get everything you want,

00:04:48.701 --> 00:04:51.328
but the mere fact
you get to decide is powerful.

00:04:51.352 --> 00:04:53.138
In fact, it's a gift.

00:04:53.162 --> 00:04:54.312
Make the most of it.